    {
     "plain": "Daddy always said you could go live your dream"
    },
    {
     "plain": "So I packed up my things, I moved to LA"
    },
    {
     "plain": "He told me watch out for some people you meet"
    },
    {
     "plain": "Jump in front of your car just to take what you can give 'em"
    },
    {
     "plain": "Mama always said that she believes in me"
    },
    {
     "plain": "\"Don't forget who you are, and keep some food in your stomach\""
    },
    {
     "plain": "Daddy's advice came true after all"
    },
    {
     "plain": "But I never had thought that it would be a woman"
    }
